# ---- MusterGo frontend environment (copy this file to ".env" and edit) ----
# This file is only needed once you deploy (Step 4 of the deployment guide).

# ---- Step 4 (deployment guide): Frontend -> Backend URL ----
# Local development: leave this commented out / unset. The Vite dev server
# proxy already routes /api requests to http://localhost:4000 automatically
# (see vite.config.js) — you don't need this file for local dev at all.
#
# Once the backend is deployed to Render, set this to that live URL so the
# deployed frontend (on Vercel) knows where to send API requests:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-app.onrender.com

# Note: Vercel env vars are set in its dashboard (Settings -> Environment
# Variables), not from this file — this .env is only for your own local
# testing against a deployed backend, if you ever need that.
